\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A biotech company is building machine learning models using Amazon SageMaker to analyze large genomic datasets for research purposes. The team is considering Amazon SageMaker Asynchronous Inference to handle these predictions efficiently. To ensure that this deployment model aligns with their requirements, they need to understand which use cases are best suited for asynchronous inference.\cb1 \
\cb3 What do you recommend?\cb1 \
