\f3\b \cb7 Underfit models experience low bias, whereas, overfit models experience high variance
\f1\b0 \cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Underfit models experience high bias, whereas, overfit models experience low variance
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
