\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 Real-time inference and serverless inference options apply to Amazon SageMaker, rather than Amazon Bedrock. Amazon Bedrock only offers on-demand or batch inference options. Therefore, both these options are incorrect.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 The company should use on-demand inference, which allows the company to pay only for the resources consumed during each inference
\f1\b0 \'a0- On-demand inference offers flexibility by charging only for the resources used during each inference, making it suitable for unpredictable or variable usage patterns. However, it is generally more costly when used frequently or over long periods because it does not benefit from cost savings associated with bulk processing. For a company looking to reduce costs, on-demand inference may not be the most economical option.\cb1 \
