\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A retail company wants to leverage machine learning to analyze customer behavior and predict future purchasing trends but lacks in-house coding expertise. The company\'92s goal is to build a model that can identify patterns in customer data and forecast sales, helping to tailor marketing strategies and inventory management. Since the team does not have any programming skills, they are considering different tools or services that would enable them to develop a machine learning model without writing any code.\cb1 \
