\f3\b \cb7 AWS Audit Manager
\f1\b0 \'a0- AWS Audit Manager helps you continuously audit your AWS usage to simplify how you assess risk and compliance with regulations and industry standards. While it is useful for compliance and audit purposes, it does not provide continuous monitoring and configuration assessment of AWS resources like AWS Config does.\cb1 \

