\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A retail company is deploying machine learning models to predict customer demand and optimize inventory management. The company needs to decide between using real-time inference vs batch inference. Understanding the key differences between these approaches, including their use cases, latency requirements, and processing needs, is crucial for optimizing the company's operations.\cb1 \
