\f2\fs32 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs38\fsmilli19200 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 Real-time inference processes data in large batches at scheduled intervals, while batch inference processes individual data points immediately as they arrive\cb1 \
