\cf2 \cb7 Overall explanation
\f1 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 Correct options:\cb1 \
\cb7 Most of the services that AWS offers are Region-specific. But few services, by definition, need to be in a global scope because of the underlying service they offer. AWS Identity and Access Management (AWS IAM), Amazon CloudFront, Amazon Route 53, and AWS Web Application Firewall (AWS WAF) are some of the global services.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 AWS Lambda
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 AWS Lambda is a compute service that lets you run code without provisioning or managing servers. AWS Lambda executes your code only when needed and scales automatically, from a few requests per day to thousands per second. AWS Lambda is a regional service.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 Amazon Rekognition
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 With Amazon Rekognition, you can identify objects, people, text, scenes, and activities in images and videos, as well as detect any inappropriate content. Amazon Rekognition also provides highly accurate facial analysis and facial search capabilities that you can use to detect, analyze, and compare faces for a wide variety of user verification, people counting, and public safety use cases. Amazon Rekognition is a regional service.\cb1 \
\cb7 Incorrect options:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 AWS Identity and Access Management (AWS IAM)
\f1\b0 \'a0- AWS Identity and Access Management (AWS IAM) enables you to manage access to AWS services and resources securely. Using AWS Identity and Access Management (AWS IAM), you can create and manage IAM users and IAM user groups, and use permissions to allow and deny their access to AWS resources.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Amazon CloudFront
\f1\b0 \'a0- Amazon CloudFront is a fast content delivery network (CDN) service that securely delivers data, videos, applications, and APIs to customers globally with low latency, and high transfer speeds, all within a developer-friendly environment.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 AWS Web Application Firewall (AWS WAF)
\f1\b0 \'a0- By using AWS Web Application Firewall (AWS WAF), you can configure web access control lists (Web ACLs) on your CloudFront distributions or Application Load Balancers to filter and block requests based on request signatures.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 As mentioned earlier, these three services are global in scope.\cb1 \
\cb7 Exam Alert:\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 Amazon S3
\f1\b0 \'a0- Amazon S3 is a unique service in the sense that it follows a global namespace but the buckets are regional. You specify an AWS Region when you create your Amazon S3 bucket. This is a regional service.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

