\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 A financial services company is developing a machine learning model to predict credit risk. During the model evaluation, the data science team notices that the model performs exceptionally well on the training data but struggles with new, unseen data, indicating overfitting. To address this issue, the team needs to identify the root cause of overfitting.\cb1 \
