\f2\fs32 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs38\fsmilli19200 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 Overfitting occurs when the model ignores the training data and makes predictions based on pre-defined rules\cb1 \
