\f3\b \cf2 \cb7 Explainability
\f1\b0 \'a0- Explainability refers to understanding and evaluating system outputs.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Fairness
\f1\b0 \'a0- Fairness addresses the impact on different groups of stakeholders in the ML ecosystem.\cb1 \

\f3\b \cb7 Controllability
\f1\b0 \'a0- Controllability refers to mechanisms for monitoring and steering AI system behavior.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 These three options are core dimensions of responsible AI.\cb1 \
